{"ID":"20240206103018-17zzubw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206103018-17zzubw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103018-17zzubw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103026-ngqb680\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103020-uc8dkdx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103026-ngqb680\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:117,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:117\u0026#125;","title":" 水飞蓟","type":"doc","updated":"20240830102033"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103026-ngqb680","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103026-ngqb680","updated":"20240206103034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产陕西、甘肃、黑龙江、河北等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈长倒卵形或椭圆形，表面淡灰棕色至黑褐色。光滑。有细纵花纹。顶端钝圆，稍宽，有一圆环，中间具点状花柱残迹，基部略窄。质坚硬。破开后可见子叶2片。浅黄白色，富油性。气微，味淡。\n【性味】\t苦，凉。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，疏肝利胆。用于肝胆湿热，胁痛，黄疸。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103020-uc8dkdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103020-uc8dkdx","updated":"20240206103020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103020-wx4apoe.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240829175749-up68c1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240829175749-up68c1u","updated":"20240829175749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 341px;","style":"width: 331px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟 2-20240829175741-yhmbx9d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 331px;\" parent-style=\"width: 341px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 720px;","style":"width: 710px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟6-20240708152127-v7yt6ad.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 710px;\" parent-style=\"width: 720px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240829175612-nw3f6nz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240829175612-nw3f6nz","updated":"20240829175652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟-20240829175612-9io6a6b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟 1-20240829175652-p6hr5t9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708150635-z3rzrff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708150635-z3rzrff","updated":"20240829175754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 435px;","style":"width: 425px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟2-20240708150635-6iz0395.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 425px;\" parent-style=\"width: 435px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 771px;","style":"width: 761px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟9-20240708152201-s3fuene.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 761px;\" parent-style=\"width: 771px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240708150807-m6mx5b9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708150807-m6mx5b9","updated":"20240829175756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 597px;","style":"width: 587px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟3-20240708150807-ug0x84z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 587px;\" parent-style=\"width: 597px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 593px;","style":"width: 583px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟5-20240708151418-qvlk1ap.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 583px;\" parent-style=\"width: 593px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708152834-9pwwper","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708152834-9pwwper","updated":"20240829175842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 525px;","style":"width: 515px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟12"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟12-20240708152925-ysy5juy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 515px;\" parent-style=\"width: 525px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 467px;","style":"width: 457px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水飞蓟 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水飞蓟 3-20240829175842-06btlb0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 457px;\" parent-style=\"width: 467px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708152325-177zzvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708152325-177zzvh","updated":"20240829175909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：与飞廉相比，水飞蓟的茎相对光滑，飞廉的茎刺比较多；水飞蓟的叶子上有水波纹；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240504161424-yg5mw4k","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"070飞廉"}]},{"ID":"20240708152327-t4jsz9f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240708152327-t4jsz9f"}},{"ID":"20240830102026-yxkmkqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-yxkmkqc","updated":"20240830102033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：水飞蓟"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-wmm1pg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-wmm1pg0","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水飞蓟《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-vwf92on","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-vwf92on","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShuǐFēiJì"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-0ml9yyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-0ml9yyn","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】水飞雉、奶蓟、老鼠簕"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-7wy2qwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-7wy2qwj","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】菊科水飞蓟属植物水飞蓟Silybummarianum（L.）Gaertn.[CarduusmarianusL.]，以瘦果入药。水飞蓟自5月初至7月初陆续开花，一个头状花序从开花至果熟需25～30天，当苞片枯黄向内卷曲成筒、顶部冠毛微张开时，标志种子已经成熟，应及时采收。用剪刀将果序剪下。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-yyru208","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-yyru208","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-v1zoeb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-v1zoeb2","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热解毒，保肝、利胆，保脑，抗X射线。对急性或慢性肝炎、肝硬化、脂肪肝、代谢中毒性肝损伤、胆石症、胆管炎及肝胆管周围炎等肝、胆炎病均有良好疗效，可使肝脏病患者自觉症状和某些生化指数如血清胆红素、白皖及球皖系数、凝血酶元、谷丙转氨酶等迅速改善。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-0bij8qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-0bij8qk","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】用水飞蓟宾（水飞蓟素、奶蓟素、西利马灵）治疗肝炎，口服每次70～140毫克，每日3次，至少服5～6周，症状改善后，给予维持量，每次35～70毫克，每日3次。用糖衣丸（每粒35毫克）亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-j78fksd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-j78fksd","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-qb1yf1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-qb1yf1v","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水飞蓟《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-iswgbbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-iswgbbd","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShuǐFēiJì"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-lf62ifd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-lf62ifd","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HerbaSilybi"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-n4jq8ge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-n4jq8ge","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】水飞雉、奶蓟、老鼠勒"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-afi7rkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-afi7rkz","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为菊科植物水飞蓟Silybummarianum（L.）Gaerth的全草及瘦果。春季采收叶，夏季采收种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-1ikv45q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-1ikv45q","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】一二年生草本。茎直立，高30～200cm，多分枝，光滑或被蛛丝状毛，有纵棱槽。叶互生，基部叶常平铺地面，成莲座状，长椭圆状披针形，深或浅羽状分裂，缘齿有尖刺，长40～80cm，宽10～30cm，表面亮绿色，有乳白色斑纹，基部抱茎；中部、上部叶片渐小，上部叶披针形。头状花序直径3～6cm，单生枝顶，总苞宽球形，总苞片革质，顶端有长刺；管状花紫红色、淡红色或少有白色。瘦果长椭圆形，暗褐色或黑色。有纵条纹及白色斑纹；冠毛多数，白色，不等长，基部合生成环。花期5～6月，果期6～7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-jshae7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-jshae7h","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】江苏、陕西、北京等地有引种栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-r229jx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-r229jx0","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】全草含有黄酮类及延胡索酸；种子含水飞蓟宾（silybin）、异水飞蓟宾、脱氢水飞蓟宾、水飞蓟宁（silydianin）、水飞蓟亭（silychristin）、水飞蓟宾聚合物及肉桂酸、肉豆蔻酸、棕榈烯酸、花生酸等。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-8dynzl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-8dynzl2","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】性寒，味苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-cdlioau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-cdlioau","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】全草用于肿疡及丹毒；果实及提取物用于肝脏病、脾脏病胆结石、黄疸和慢性咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-sxzqp5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-sxzqp5d","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-5g7sby7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-5g7sby7","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水飞蓟《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-k4px2oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-k4px2oi","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】始载于《拉汉种子植物名称》。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-r8pewte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-r8pewte","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShuǐFēiJì"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-kdq9uok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-kdq9uok","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】all-grassofSt.Marys,all-grassofBlessedThistle,all-grassofHolyThistle"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-j7a2cgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-j7a2cgi","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】水飞雉、奶蓟、老鼠簕"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-8dkvnz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-8dkvnz8","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-2wgvb2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-2wgvb2g","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为菊科植物水飞蓟的瘦果。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-h7qpuy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-h7qpuy3","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Silybummarianum(L.)Gaertn.[CarduusmarianusL.]"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-w39sle8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-w39sle8","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋季采收，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-vq6iqef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-vq6iqef","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】水飞蓟一年生或二年生草本，高30-120cm。茎直立，多分枝，有棱长。基生叶大，莲座状，具柄，叶片长椭圆状披针形，长15-40cm，宽6-14cm，羽状深裂，缘齿有硬刺尖，叶上面具光泽，有很多乳白色斑纹，下面短毛，脉上被长糙毛，中脉于叶背显着凸出；茎生叶较小，基部抱茎。头状花序，直径4-6cm，顶生或腋生，弯垂；总苞宽，近球形；总苞片多层，质硬，具长刺，或外层的先端估尖；花托肉质，具硬托毛；花全为管状花，两性；淡紫色或紫红色，赤有白色。瘦果，椭圆形，长约7mm，宽约3mm，棕色或深棕色，表面有纵纹，腺体突起；冠毛白色，刚毛状。花果期5-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-cnbpoxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-cnbpoxb","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于通风、凉爽、干燥和阳光充足的荒滩地、盐碱地等处。现华北、西北地区有引种栽培。原产南欧至北非。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-m64rgjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-m64rgjf","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】本品果中含二氢出柰酚（dihydrokaemp-ferol），水飞蓟素（silybin），3-羟基水飞蓟莫林（silydianim），次水飞蓟素（silychristin），亚麻酸（linolenicacid），亚油酸（linoleicacid），油酸（olicacid），棕榈酸（behenicacid），水飞蓟莫林（silymonin），水飞蓟兰君（silandrin），异次水飞蓟素（isostlychristin），槲皮素（quercetin）。种子中含水飞蓟醇（isosilychristin），槲皮素（quercetin）。种子中含水飞蓟醇（silybonol），肉豆蔻酸（myristicacid），棕榈酸，硬脂酸，油酸，花旗松素（taxiflin），去氢水飞蓟素（dehydrosidrosilybin），次水飞蓟素，水飞蓟素。3-羟基水飞蓟莫林，2，3-去氢水飞蓟马林（2，3-dehydroilymarin），2，3-去氢次水飞苞素（2,3-dehydrosilychri-stin），盐酸甜菜碱（betainehydrochloride），半胱氨酸（cys-teine），甘氨酸（glycine），谷氨酸（glutamicacid），2-氨基丁酸（2-aminobutyricacid），亮氨酸（leucine），酪胺（tyramine），亚油酸。另外，在种子油（干重27.2%的半干燥油）中含脂肪酸主要为C16：0（9.4%）、C18：1（27.1%）、C18：2（55.3%），生育酚和甾醇含量分别为38mg/g和670mg%g，甾醇部分中含胆甾醇（cholesterol），菜油甾醇（campesterol），豆甾醇（stigmasteroil），谷甾醇（sitosterol），4-甲基-24-亚乙基-7-胆甾烯醇（24-ethylidenelophenol），粗蛋白。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-52dvstw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-52dvstw","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】水飞蓟素，又名西马利灵，有保肝和治疗肝病的作用，能对抗肝脏中毒，并有抗x-光射线的作用，没有毒性，即使长期服用也无不良反应。该成分日本已合成。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-dyl27vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-dyl27vo","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味苦；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-qijphph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-qijphph","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热利湿；疏肝利胆。主慢性肝炎；肝硬化脂肪肝；胆石症；胆管炎"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-zncrt8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-zncrt8z","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，，6-15g；或制成冲剂、胶囊、丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-0y98mku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-0y98mku","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《新华本草纲要》：有解毒的功能。用于黄疸、肝硬化、肝肿大及其他肝病、胆结石。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102026-jluxztk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102026-jluxztk","updated":"20240830102032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102027-e5ss5xt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830102027-e5ss5xt","updated":"20240830102032"}},{"ID":"20240830102028-jz2q9ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102028-jz2q9ce","updated":"20240830102032"}}]}